## FROZEN-EX16-v1 cantilever design-domain mesh (Stage 1 and Stage 2 share this mesh)
## Domain: brick x in [0,2], y in [0,1], z in [0,1]; HEX8 mapped mesh 48 x 24 x 24, h = 1/24
reset
brick x 2.0 y 1.0 z 1.0
## brick is created centred at the origin; move its corner to the origin
move volume 1 x 1.0 y 0.5 z 0.5 include_merged
## structured (mapped) hex mesh with uniform element size h = 1/24
volume 1 scheme map
volume 1 size 0.041666666667
curve with length > 1.5 interval 48
curve with length < 1.5 interval 24
mesh volume 1
## single element block containing every element, named block_1, HEX8
block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "block_1"
block 1 element type HEX8
## ns_fix: all nodes on the face x = 0 (surface whose centroid has x = 0)
nodeset 1 add surface with x_coord < 0.001
nodeset 1 name "ns_fix"
## ns_load: all nodes on the edge x = 2, y = 0 (curve whose centroid is (2, 0, 0.5))
nodeset 2 add curve with x_coord > 1.999 and y_coord < 0.001
nodeset 2 name "ns_load"
## report counts for the journal log
list block 1
list nodeset 1
list nodeset 2
## export Exodus II, dimension 3
export mesh "mesh.exo" dimension 3 overwrite
